#: f1a079d17e5747ca9d46160213bb67e5 of pybroker.vect.atr:1
msgid "Computes Average True Range (ATR)."
msgstr "计算平均真实波幅（Average True Range，ATR）。"

#: a88039fbfe8c4b158147195c7dac2b27 of pybroker.vect.atr:3
msgid ""
"True range is the greatest of ``high - low``, ``abs(high - previous "
"close)``, and ``abs(low - previous close)``."
msgstr ""
"真实波幅取 ``high - low``、``abs(high - previous close)`` 和 ``abs(low - "
"previous close)`` 三者中的最大值。"

#: 19f15363880c43849f7cd27cdbdb3551 of pybroker.vect.atr:11
msgid ""
":class:`numpy.ndarray` of the ``lookback``-bar averages of true range. "
"The first ``lookback`` values are ``NaN``, since the true range of the "
"first bar has no previous close."
msgstr ""
"由真实波幅的 ``lookback`` 根 K 线均值组成的 :class:`numpy.ndarray`。前 ``lookback`` 个值为 "
"``NaN``，因为第一根 K 线的真实波幅没有前一根 K 线的收盘价可供参考。"

